{"ref":"BDB, שִׂיד","hw":"שִׂיד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂיד</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>lime, whitewash</strong>;—always <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span>;—<em>lime</em>, produced by burning bones <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:1\" href=\"/Amos.2.1\">Am 2:1</a>, in sim. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.12\">Is 33:12</a>; as <em>whitewash</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.2\">Dt 27:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.4\">4</a>.","next":"BDB, שִׂיד²","prev":"BDB, שׂיד"}